  "description": {
   "en": "0-3. Lucky Noel\nNoel was an abandoned orphan, adopted by a nearby kingdom with a prophet-king that has some very strange plans in mind for his subjects! Noel's journey is full of suffering, pain, humiliation and bloody battles, but she endures as she wants her revenge!\n\n4-6. Sweet Fruit\nAn overwhelmingly powerful knight slaughters goblins and reaps the oh-so-sweet rewards.\n\n6.5. Bonus Goblin Comic Theater\n___\n**Buy *Lucky Noel* Chapters Individually:**\n- [Amazon](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B09DXXYFV8)\n- [BOOK☆WALKER](https://bookwalker.jp/series/313617/)\n- [ebookjapan](https://ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp/books/653003/)\n\n**Buy *Sweet Fruit* Chapters Individually:**\n- [Amazon](https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B09DXWPV94)\n- [BOOK☆WALKER](https://bookwalker.jp/series/313618/)\n- [ebookjapan](https://ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp/books/653004/)"
